[sometimes] the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرَوَان</span> [or <i>stone-curlew</i>]: pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعَاقِيقُ</span>. (TA.)

